{"generation_call_already_reserved":true,"id":"legal_skill_evolution_mixed_component_training_validated_updates_20261115:read:3b1e02b128d3b120decff0dad995ba08b419d5b2e3a01d1e89044d2a7634b095","payload":{"chat_template_kwargs":{"enable_thinking":false},"max_tokens":8192,"messages":[{"content":"完整读取 current facts 中明确发生的 payment。主动“X paid Y”保留 payer=X；被动“Y was paid”可以建立 payee=Y，但未说明付款人时 payer=null。仅称 income 或 earned、没有付款措辞时不进入 payments，而进入 annual_income_boundaries。保留 payment_term、全部明确 payees、amount、原样 medium、temporal_precision、stated_year、仅在 facts 给出完整日期时存在的 payment_date，以及可选 purpose_entity。year_only 或服务期间绝不能生成付款 start_。linked_service 只在同一 facts 陈述明确说明付款用于服务时填写；worker、employer、人物原文、service_term、kind、venue、location/country 和服务端点必须由来源支持。已知 payer 必须等于 employer，worker 必须属于 payees。“domestic service”本身不能生成 private home。is_query 标记只能对齐 facts 已建立的唯一事件，不能建立发生、日期或法律适用性。每条正记录必须有 facts witness；问题不能建立付款。complete 空数组表示完整有限读取后没有付款，unread 使用 null。\nShared native event meanings: Shared factual encoding from the author statute program:\nservice_(event), agent_(service,worker), patient_(service,employer).\npayment_(event), agent_(payment,payer), patient_(payment,payee),\npurpose_(payment,service_event), amount_(payment,amount).\npurpose_(service,\"domestic service\"|\"agricultural labor\") is a stated service kind.\nmarriage_(event) has an agent_ fact for EACH spouse.\ndeath_(event) has agent_(event,deceased), start_(event,actual_death_date).\nenrollment_(event) has agent_(event,student), patient_(event,institution).\nattending_classes_(event) has agent_(event,student), location_(event,institution).\neducational_institution_(event) has agent_(event,institution).\nincome_(event) has agent_(event,recipient), amount_(event,amount).\nstart_/end_ describe the dates/period of that SAME event, not arbitrary dates\nbelonging to a different event. A stated annual income can be represented over\nits stated calendar year with canonical year bounds; this does not invent the\ndate of an instantaneous payment. Never allocate a cross-year payment or give\nit a payment date copied from a service period without support.\n\nExplicit source-stated intermediate legal givens, with ordered arguments:\ns151_b_applies(taxpayer:string,spouse:string,year:integer)\ns151_c_applies(taxpayer:string,dependent:string,year:integer)\ns63_f_1_A(taxpayer:string,year:integer)\ns63_f_1_B(taxpayer:string,spouse:string,year:integer)\ns151_b(taxpayer:string,exemption_amount:number,year:integer)\ns152_c_1(dependent:string,taxpayer:string,year:integer)\nKeep source polarity and taxpayer/beneficiary direction. A151(d) statement is not automatically a151(b)/(c) fact. Never assert the target predicate or infer unstated ages, deaths or relationships. This is shared infrastructure, not learned legal knowledge.","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"task\": {\"current_case\": {\"facts\": \"Alice has paid $3200 to Bob for domestic service done from Feb 1st, 2017 to Sep 2nd, 2017, in Caracas, Venezuela. Alice is an American employer.\", \"question\": \"Section 3306(c)(1) applies to Alice employing Bob for the year 2017.\\nNative query constraints from this same original TRAIN task (truth value not supplied): s3306_c_1(\\\"domestic service\\\",2017).\"}, \"current_legal_query\": {\"native_query\": [{\"arguments\": [\"domestic service\", 2017], \"predicate\": \"s3306_c_1\"}], \"query_clause\": \"s3306_c_1\"}, \"component_meanings\": {\"general_payment_events\": \"facts 明确陈述的全部离散付款，包括 payer 未陈述的被动付款；年度收入陈述保持为边界，年度或服务区间不被改写为即时付款日。\"}}, \"output_schema\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"general_payment_events\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"views\"], \"properties\": {\"views\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 1, \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"extraction_status\", \"payments\", \"annual_income_boundaries\", \"witnesses\"], \"properties\": {\"extraction_status\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"com